/-!
# The MS93 selected-neighbor generation identity

`local_neighbor_generation` proves the exact inclusion required by the
centralizer-path assembly. `source_neighbor_generation` gives the full
identity for any incident pair under the earlier source inputs.
The proof uses the actual natural action, edge transfer and commutators of
selected neighboring elements to recover every fixed component.

The existing conditional native-lift route remains available separately.
Source: Meierfrankenfeld--Stellmacher (1993), the display immediately before
(4.3.2)(4), printed p.884.
-/
